"\n"
"Writes only reports 0x07, 0x06, 0x11 (and 0x05 for the active profile). Factory reset via report 0x09 is never used.\n"
"Kone XP Air: only blocks 0x47, 0x46, 0x43 and 0x45; factory reset (0x49), pairing and firmware update are blocked."

